  "title": "show_exception: Add include",
  "description": "show_exception refers to packet_info and proto_tree. These could be\nincomplete types, but nearly everything that includes show_exception\nwill include proto.h (directly or indirectly) anyway. This should make\nthe Debian header check slightly happier. This header had no public\nfunctions until recently (0d280980c32bc71a7b3bb0177e9f64b38cbee3f6)\nalthough it was in the list of public headers in CMakeLists.txt",
